cla_mmrs: correct CLA MMR register descriptions

The CLA MMR spec descriptions had several defects that flowed through to
the generated dfd_cla.rdl and the register documentation: the EnableCla
bit description contradicted itself on the clock-gating polarity, the
CDbgEapStatus layout was described as two bits per EAP rather than the
actual per-EAP status/write-to-clear split, the EAP count read "8" where
there are 16, and a handful of spelling errors (specifc, enbale_cla,
upper_targe, "One of he").

Recorded as a patch so the hand-mirrored upstream/ tree stays
reproducible from the vendored spec plus patches/ applied in order,
ahead of wiring the package through bender vendor.
